* SplitPatches            (int) = 0        Split every patch that many times in 2^d patches
* SquareDiscretization (string) = global   Element equalisation: off (native, lightest, conforming inputs only) | global (all patches identical, always safe)
* StretchGeometry        (real) = 1        Stretch geometry in x-direction by the given factor
* num_run                 (int) = 10       Number of times every solve is repeated; the reported solve time is the mean over the repeats (setup is measured once)
* plot                   (bool) = 0        Write geometry, source and solution to Paraview files

